 "remarks": "The Best of Darien at Your Doorstep! A circular driveway welcomes you to this charming 1920s Craftsman Colonial, where timeless character meets modern sophistication. Set on nearly 1/3 level acre, the home features new 6-inch oak floors throughout. The stunning white kitchen boasts Calacatta Gold quartz countertops, a generous island, and seamless flow to the dining room. A first-floor en-suite bedroom offers flexibility, while upstairs features a new primary suite, two additional bedrooms, and convenient laundry. Outside, enjoy an in-ground pool, patio, level lawn, and oversized detached garage. Just 1/2 mile to Darien Commons and Noroton Heights train station, with sidewalks to shopping, dining, and parks. The ultimate Darien lifestyle!",
